CM_ SG_ 704 EVEN_PARITY_BIT "If no. of 1s in Bit0 to 6 of Byte0 is odd, then Byte0.7 = 1 to make it even parity.
If no. of 1s in Bit0 to 6 of Byte0 is even, then Byte0.7 = 0 to retain even parity.
In case all values from Bit0 to 6 is 0, then Byte0.7 = 0. 
On-fail value is 0x0.

";
